  <StreamGeometry x:Key="IconScan">M3 7V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h2 M17 3h2a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v2 M21 17v2a2 2 0 0 1-2 2h-2 M7 21H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-2 M7 12h10</StreamGeometry>
